CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790362102
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASupreme Court allows Trump to use
OL,4,Acontroversial database to check voter
OL,5,Acitizenship
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the top court's conservative
OL,8,Fmajority ruled that the National Voter
OL,9,FRegistration Act prohibits broad purges
OL,10,Fof voter rolls in the weeks before an
OL,11,Felection, which limits any "potential
OL,12,Fimpact" of the decision ahead of the
OL,13,Fmidterms.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
